<h5>Welcome</h5>
<h3>From the Principal</h3>
<p>&ldquo;Don&rsquo;t limit the child to your own learning, for he was born on another time&rdquo; &ndash; Rabindranath Tagore</p>
<p>Started in the year 2007 with an aim of imparting quality education to expatriate Indian students, Al Muna is challengingly moving ahead to make their students valuable global citizens. Al Muna believes that the education we impart should cater to their present needs and achieve all-round development. Our curriculum is rigorous and challenging and will continue to be so with the alignment of the CBSE.</p>
<p>It is truly a close family experience for staff and children alike in Al Muna. Children get individual attention, care and love. In my service as principal, I take much pride in the fact that our staff works diligently to maintain high educational standards for every child. A hardworking, sincere and committed team of teachers is our specialty.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a class="site-button-primary" href="/about-us/">Principal&#39;s Message</a></p>
</div>
