<h5>Welcome to Al Muna International School</h5>
<h2>Providing World Class Education</h2>
<p>Al Muna provides a balanced, safe and realistic environment for young children to grow and learn. The school turns out young boys and girls into good citizens with a well developed personality, prepared to engage with and contribute to the community at a national and global level.</p>
<p>Al Muna International School, affiliated to CBSE, New Delhi and recognized by the Ministry of Education, KSA, was established by the managing committee of TP Group of Institutions in the year 2007. The motto of our school, as rightly stated in our logo, is &ldquo;Moral, Modern, and Mastery&rdquo;. Our aim is to mould children into wholesome personalities through an equal emphasis on Academics, Fine Arts, Sports, and other extracurricular activities.</p>
<p>The emphasis is on academic excellence, social work and all-round development of the personality of the children. Our distinctive character is to provide world-class education and our concern is to provide a high quality learning environment that is innovative, challenging and enterprising.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a class="site-button-primary" href="/about-us/">About Us</a></p>
</div>
