<td>
<h3>Syllabus and Classes</h3>
<p>The school follows the CBSE syllabus with English as the medium of instruction, offering English, Hindi, Mathematics, Science/EVS, Social Science and Arabic, along with auxiliary subjects including Saudi History and Culture, Computer Science, General Knowledge and Islamic Studies/Moral Science.</p>
<p><a class="site-button-primary" href="/academics/">EXPLORE ACADEMICS</a></p>
</td>
