<h3>All-round development</h3>
<p>Apart from the normal studies, the school also provides a number of co-scholastic activities for the all-round development of children, carried out through different programmes inside and outside the classrooms. Public speaking is introduced to the students as early as KG through presentations given at the assembly, and monthly Zeal Training classes help improve their self-confidence and mental ability.</p>
<p><a class="site-button-primary" href="/why-us/">WHY AL MUNA</a></p>
</td>
