<h3>Join Al Muna</h3>
<p>The children who meet the required age criteria for various classes are considered for admission after a successful written test and interview. Children seeking admission in LKG should complete 4 years, and for Class One 6 years, by April of the respective academic year. Only completed application forms with the required documents will be considered for admission.</p>
<p><a class="site-button-primary" href="/admission-process/">ADMISSION PROCESS</a></p>
</td>
